# Results v2: 35 public items across models and arms (development step N6a)

Source of every figure: `eval/runs/v2/summary.json` (made by `python3 eval/run_v2.py report` from the records under `eval/runs/v2/<model>/<arm>/` and the grades in `eval/runs/v2/judge/`). Grader: `gpt-oss:20b` thinking medium (rubric `eval/judge.py` for the 20 answerable items, `eval/judge_v2.py` `RUBRIC_UN` for the 15 unanswerable items). Classes are defined in `eval/GRADING-v2.md`. 'Majority' means more than half of the runs of an item.

