## Grader cross-check (gpt-oss:20b answers graded by gpt-oss:20b and by gemma4:12b thinking off)

Same verdict on 432 of 454 answers (95.2%); Cohen's kappa on Y/N 0.899.
- arm A0, answerable items: 89 of 100 the same
- arm A0, unanswerable items: 71 of 75 the same
- arm A3, answerable items: 100 of 100 the same
- arm A3, unanswerable items: 69 of 75 the same
- arm A4, answerable items: 59 of 59 the same
- arm A4, unanswerable items: 44 of 45 the same

Disagreements: 22 (listed in `eval/runs/v2/summary.json` under `judge_disagreements`).

